# MQTT contract

Read `docs/workflows/mqtt-contract.md` for full details.

## Fixed contract (do not break)

- Base topic: `config.mqtt.topic` (default `daikinToMQTT`)
- `INSTANCE_ID`: `960adb71-4632-4f53-bf47-8ffa5abd7581`
- State keys: `_propertyKey` prefix on device JSON (`{deviceId}`)
- Jeedom CMD suffixes: `_ON` / `_OFF` (binary), `_Slider` (numeric), `_Select` (string)
- Commands in: `{deviceId}/set` as `{ "_key": value }`
- Jeedom discovery: `jeedom/{deviceId}` array from `generateCMD()`

## Safe changes

Adding new `_propertyKey` fields and new Jeedom CMD entries (auto-discovered).

## Breaking changes (need daikinRCCloud update)

Renaming/removing logicalIDs, changing suffix patterns, changing `_device` shape, changing `/set` format.

## Special commands (CharacteristicWriter.ts)

`_triggerFirmwareUpdate`, `_setPresetAway`, `_{zone}_scheduleEnabled` — document new ones in mqtt-contract.md.
